title: "When Can Quantum Extreme Learning Machines Replace Quantum Reservoirs?"
abstract: >-
  Code, data, figures, and manuscript sources studying when recent inputs
  suffice to reproduce a quantum reservoir's outputs, separating missing
  history, model capacity, and measurement error.
